      "name": "Clothes Grab",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "A creature hit by the animated wardrobe's clothes whip becomes Grabbed by the animated wardrobe. The creature isn't Immobilized, but it can't move beyond the reach of the wardrobe's clothes whip. A creature can sever the clothes whip with a Strike against AC 15 that deals at least 5 slashing damage. This deals no damage to the animated wardrobe."
